                                "en": "He looked at me with a <w>feigned</w> angry look, but I could see he wanted to laugh."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "De cabaretier sprak op een <w>quasi</w> serieuze toon over de politieke situatie.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "it": "Il cabarettista ha parlato con un tono <w>finto</w> serio della situazione politica.",
                                "en": "The comedian spoke in a <w>pseudo-</w>serious tone about the political situation."
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "synonyms": [
                        "alsof"
                    ],
                    "common_phrases": [
